00:12:34.128 --> 00:12:36.255
[Chieko] <i>My husband had</i> <i>a strong sense of justice.</i>

00:12:36.338 --> 00:12:39.675
<i>- I hope he'll be remembered for that.</i> - [reporter 1] <i>Did you find documents</i>

00:12:39.759 --> 00:12:41.969
