00:12:43.012 --> 00:12:44.555
I mean, he just died.

00:12:44.638 --> 00:12:46.849
[reporter 2] <i>Do you think</i> <i>the threat led to his suicide?</i>

00:12:47.433 --> 00:12:49.351
