00:17:18.412 --> 00:17:19.621
Sakamoto,

00:17:21.123 --> 00:17:23.333
Do you have any idea what you're asking me to do?

00:17:24.168 --> 00:17:26.962
[Sakamoto] <i>Do </i>you <i>have any idea</i> <i>who these people are?</i>

00:17:27.755 --> 00:17:29.339
