Sometimes people come in to look at the Polaroids over there.

00:33:50.570 --> 00:33:53.197
My dad would post pics of customers on the wall.

00:33:54.282 --> 00:33:57.160
They're not mine, but I couldn't just throw them away,

00:33:57.660 --> 00:34:00.329
So I put them up. Call it a link to the past.

